# Only sentences that NAME WordNet belong here. A bare definition or
# synonym question ('define X', 'what does X mean') is answered by the
# fallback handler through wordnet_query.voc, which scores low and yields
# to any skill with a better answer. Adding the skill-free forms back here
# makes this skill claim every definition question in the pipeline.
ask (word net|wordnet) about {word}
search (word net|wordnet) for {word}
what does (word net|wordnet) say about {word}
